'''Moulds''' are crafting components found in various places in the [[Deep North]].

[[File:Deep North crafting moulds.png|thumb|Several moulds laid on the ground]]

They are used as crafting ingredients at a [[Black Forge]] or [[Galdr Table]] to craft Casts for Deep North [[Weapons]], [[Armor]]s and the [[Intricate Key]].
The Cast can then be placed in a [[Frost Foundry]] fueled by [[Liquid Frost]] to produce the final item.

Moulds cannot be reused and are consumed to make a Cast.

