== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Greydwarfs|Aggressive creature strategies#Greydwarf}}
Similarly to regular Greydwarf, they have a melee attack and a throw attack. Both attack deal [[Frost]] damage and thus can slow down the player.

They are afraid of fire, like regular Greydwarf.

